==Other Appearances==
==={{CoH|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Stub|CoH}}
[[File:CoH Ice Keese Sprite.png|right|150px]]
Ice Keese appear as [[Enemy|Enemies]] in {{CoH}} where they move to the beat of the music. They share their beat pattern with other [[Keese]], always moving on every two music beats. At first glance, their movement is erratic, but they will always pause on one beat before moving onto an adjacent tile, with their bodies always facing the direction they want to go. For every few beats, their bodies are temporarily engulfed in an icy mist, and if either [[Cadence]], [[Link]], [[Yves]], or [[Zelda]] touch or attack them while they are in this state, they will become frozen in an [[Ice Block]] for several beats. However, the mist will eventually fade away, rendering them vulnerable for a few beats before their bodies become icy cold again in order to repeat the pattern.
{{Noncanon|End}}

==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Stub|AoC}}
Ice Keese may drop [[Ice Keese Wing]]s or [[Keese Eyeball]]s when defeated. For each defeated in a [[Battle]], the [[Warrior]]s will be awarded a [[Keese Trophy]] at its end.
{{Noncanon|End}}

